@startuml
title OmniDesk Requirements Traceability

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

rectangle "Approved Requirements" as Requirements
rectangle "System Design Artifacts" as Design
rectangle "Product Backlog Items" as Backlog
rectangle "Sprint Tasks" as Tasks
rectangle "Implementation" as Implementation
rectangle "Automated Tests" as Tests
rectangle "Release Evidence" as Evidence

Requirements --> Design : guide
Requirements --> Backlog : become work
Design --> Backlog : define solution
Backlog --> Tasks : selected for sprint
Tasks --> Implementation : produce code
Implementation --> Tests : verified by
Tests --> Evidence : provide proof
Implementation --> Evidence : reviewed increment

note bottom of Evidence
Traceability connects project intent
to implementation and verification.
end note

@enduml